- Top vertices: T1, T2, T3
- Middle vertices (left to right): M1, M2, M3, M4
- Bottom vertices: B1, B2, B3
- Leftmost vertex: L (connected to M1, B1)
- Rightmost vertex: R (connected to M4, B3)
Assume standard connections: T1 to M1/M2, T2 to M2/M3, T3 to M3/M4; B1 to M1/M2, B2 to M2/M3, B3 to M3/M4.

